ard it  briefly there that this parole of eric  smith actually liberates them and what  what uh doreen roby told me when i said  so what are you thinking she goes i'll  tell you what i'm not thinking i'm not  thinking about eric smith anymore and  that is its own value i don't need to  think about them i can just do whatever  i need to to move on with my life jim uh  as always fascinating reporting thank  you very much you can see more of jim's  report eric smith gambling on a killer  on 48 hours tomorrow night at 10 9  central right here on cbs and on our  streaming service paramount plus
 

